3d-default.txt:
3D Default
This is a light-weight resourcepack mainly provides vanilla-look 3D models.
Features
- Minecraft version support from 1.8 to latest (packs for Minecraft below 1.14 can only found in github page; packs for snapshots can be manually downloaded from github)
- 3D Models with vanilla-look textures;
- Optifine Custom Entity Models(not support 1.8 with Optifine version below L5);

effectual.txt:
New atmospheric effects:
- Steam from the mouth in cold biomes (if the player is running, the particles appear more frequently);
- Bubbles from the mouth while you have oxygen underwater;
- Bubbles from an open chest underwater;
- Drip effect from the player when he comes out of the water;
- New effects for lamps, fires and campfires (and their soul analogues);
- Sparks from burning entities, just like from fire and campfires;
- Additional effects from running on snow or sand;
- Footprints while walking on snow;
- Small snow residue left after walking off snowy surfaces;
- Cave dust;
- Columns of steam when water and hot blocks come into contact (like lava or a cauldron with lava);
- Sparks from under the wheels of a minecart when moving at high speed;
- Bubbles now appear from decorated pots when underwater;
- Sparks now appear when hitting metal blocks with iron, gold, or netherite too

voxy-extra.txt:
Voxy Extra
Voxy Extra is a Voxy addon, which adds features that shouldn't be in Voxy. It may be out of scope features, bad design features, etc.
Features
General
- Nether Fog "Fix": Allows seeing Voxy chunks in the nether;
- Fade Fog Settings: Allows changing Voxy 0.2.19+ fade fog values (0.2.5+);
- Server Blacklist: Allows disabling Voxy on specific servers;
- Server Whitelist: Allows enabling Voxy only on specific servers (0.2.1+);
- LoD Mirror: Allows setting one LoD storage for multiple servers;
- LoD Merge: Allows setting one LoD storage for servers containing similar addresses (0.2.6+);
- Disabling Voxy in singleplayer (0.2.1+);
- Toggle Voxy keybind (0.2.7+).
Flashback
- Copying LoDs with replays: Allows to show proper LoD state in old replays, also enabling ingesting. Disabled by default.
ReplayMod
- Functionality of Voxy ReplayMod Compat (0.2.2+).
